WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:16.264
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:16.534 --> 00:22.869
(Firefly Theater)

3
00:43.456 --> 00:47.392
♪Neon lights twist into a knot♪

4
00:49.024 --> 00:52.608
♪I rest in the ruins of defeat♪

5
00:53.184 --> 00:55.520
♪You tap your fingers lightly♪

6
00:55.904 --> 00:58.656
♪I fall into the abyss♪

7
00:59.488 --> 01:02.080
♪I've seen this game before♪

8
01:02.080 --> 01:04.768
♪Every single move was calculated♪

9
01:04.768 --> 01:07.168
♪I finally see your silhouette♪

10
01:07.552 --> 01:10.304
♪Just an empty shell♪

11
01:10.624 --> 01:13.440
♪I've broken this game before♪

12
01:13.440 --> 01:15.872
♪Every move was placed wrong♪

13
01:15.872 --> 01:18.016
♪Now it's my turn to play♪

14
01:18.208 --> 01:25.056
♪I'll show you what stunning looks like♪

15
01:25.728 --> 01:28.256
♪When I stand back up again♪

16
01:28.544 --> 01:30.400
♪The whole city goes dark♪

17
01:31.264 --> 01:33.952
♪For the part you owe me♪

18
01:34.112 --> 01:41.088
♪I'll make you pay double♪

19
01:42.624 --> 01:47.360
♪You're just my starting point♪

20
01:51.712 --> 01:52.739
=The Vanishing Beauty=

21
01:53.000 --> 01:55.720
=Episode 9=

22
01:59.169 --> 01:59.930
Wait for me.

23
02:00.050 --> 02:00.529
I'll go up

24
02:00.609 --> 02:01.529
and grab your crutches.

25
02:02.249 --> 02:03.050
No need.

26
02:03.729 --> 02:04.329
Leaning on you

27
02:04.369 --> 02:05.650
is way better than crutches.

28
02:06.130 --> 02:06.770
These days,

29
02:06.850 --> 02:08.370
my underarms got completely chafed.

30
02:08.449 --> 02:09.090
It hurt so much.

31
02:10.530 --> 02:11.729
The company reimburses

32
02:11.889 --> 02:13.769
taxi fares for overtime.

33
02:13.970 --> 02:14.970
Don't push yourself

34
02:15.169 --> 02:15.889
to drive.

35
02:16.769 --> 02:17.889
I wanted to practice a bit.

36
02:19.970 --> 02:20.690
When

37
02:20.929 --> 02:22.169
did you get your license?

38
02:22.729 --> 02:23.329
Two days ago.

39
02:24.889 --> 02:25.929
Maybe I should

40
02:25.970 --> 02:26.609
drive instead.

41
02:27.970 --> 02:29.049
Can your foot handle it?

42
02:30.410 --> 02:31.010
Sure.

43
02:31.690 --> 02:32.480
Stepping on the gas

44
02:32.729 --> 02:33.850
doesn't take much effort.

45
02:34.290 --> 02:34.769
The keys.

46
02:35.049 --> 02:35.929
All right, you drive.

47
02:36.609 --> 02:37.130
Let's go.

48
02:44.769 --> 02:45.370
Honey.

49
02:49.889 --> 02:50.850
Why were you there?

50
02:52.970 --> 02:54.010
I had a dinner somewhere

51
02:54.810 --> 02:55.570
near the office.

52
02:56.169 --> 02:57.250
Parking was awful there,

53
02:57.570 --> 02:58.329
so I had Zhang Tao

54
02:58.489 --> 02:59.476
park back at the office.

55
02:59.850 --> 03:01.209
I didn't expect to run into you.

56
03:02.929 --> 03:03.850
You and Zhang Yu

57
03:03.850 --> 03:04.570
seemed close.

58
03:05.010 --> 03:06.010
She's your top performer.

59
03:07.410 --> 03:08.130
I quite like her.

60
03:09.090 --> 03:09.570
Honey,

61
03:09.889 --> 03:11.690
how much does someone like her

62
03:11.929 --> 03:13.130
make in a year?

63
03:13.489 --> 03:14.130
It rises yearly

64
03:14.609 --> 03:15.572
based on performance.

65
03:15.649 --> 03:16.290
And bonuses.

66
03:17.530 --> 03:18.209
Why do you ask?

67
03:19.929 --> 03:20.810
Her car looks like

68
03:20.889 --> 03:22.130
it costs over a million RMB.

69
03:22.489 --> 03:23.810
Her salary alone definitely

70
03:23.929 --> 03:24.690
wouldn't cover it.

71
03:25.609 --> 03:26.090
Word is

72
03:26.570 --> 03:27.609
she's a stock market pro.

73
03:28.329 --> 03:29.130
But I can't ask

74
03:29.370 --> 03:30.049
for details.

75
03:32.489 --> 03:33.250
I see.

76
03:33.850 --> 03:34.769
Your leg is all better?

77
03:35.370 --> 03:36.010
You can drive?

78
03:36.329 --> 03:37.850
I didn't dare ride in Zhang Yu's car.

79
03:38.250 --> 03:38.810
She told me

80
03:38.810 --> 03:40.209
she got her license two days ago.

81
03:40.449 --> 03:41.889
I value my life too much to risk it.

82
03:42.370 --> 03:43.290
If your leg is better,

83
03:43.929 --> 03:44.929
let's let Ms. Hui go.

84
03:45.690 --> 03:47.049
She came to me privately again,

85
03:47.690 --> 03:48.810
saying she must leave.

86
03:49.209 --> 03:50.449
Being a housekeeper for so long

87
03:50.889 --> 03:51.570
has worn her out.

88
03:51.970 --> 03:52.889
She can't handle it.

89
03:53.609 --> 03:53.970
She wants

90
03:54.090 --> 03:55.209
to rest for a while.

91
03:56.049 --> 03:56.929
Why does Ms. Hui

92
03:57.049 --> 03:57.929
always come to you,

93
03:57.929 --> 03:59.729
not me, when something comes up?

94
04:01.010 --> 04:02.489
Ms. Hui said you're too sentimental,

95
04:02.810 --> 04:03.649
afraid you'd cry.

96
04:04.209 --> 04:06.090
Seeing you cry would make her cry, too.

97
04:06.489 --> 04:07.850
But she said she has to leave

98
04:08.449 --> 04:09.370
and that she's sorry.

99
04:11.209 --> 04:12.247
You trusted her so much.

100
04:13.570 --> 04:14.090
Later,

101
04:14.370 --> 04:15.609
once we have a baby,

102
04:15.729 --> 04:16.649
we can hire her back,

103
04:17.370 --> 04:18.449
and you'll see her again.

104
04:19.675 --> 04:20.449
I'll book her a ticket

105
04:20.449 --> 04:21.375
for one of these days.

106
04:24.250 --> 04:24.690
Honey,

107
04:25.889 --> 04:27.089
since your leg is healed,

108
04:27.969 --> 04:28.610
can we sleep

109
04:29.529 --> 04:30.690
in the same room tonight?

110
04:30.730 --> 04:32.570
Not yet, honey.

111
04:33.810 --> 04:34.730
With my leg,

112
04:35.089 --> 04:36.449
walking a few steps is fine,

113
04:36.769 --> 04:38.100
but walking too much still hurts.

114
04:38.329 --> 04:39.769
Besides, the scab just formed.

115
04:40.209 --> 04:41.529
It itches like crazy at night.

116
04:41.690 --> 04:42.930
I just keep scratching it.

117
04:43.170 --> 04:44.649
I'm worried it'll keep you awake.

118
04:45.209 --> 04:46.529
Wait until I'm fully recovered.

119
04:46.930 --> 04:47.690
All right.

120
04:48.250 --> 04:49.490
Poor thing.

121
05:02.730 --> 05:03.289
Honey,

122
05:04.010 --> 05:04.810
not done yet?

123
05:05.690 --> 05:07.209
Yeah, honey.

124
05:07.810 --> 05:08.810
I'm getting sleepy.

125
05:09.769 --> 05:11.329
Could you pour me a cup of coffee?

126
05:11.610 --> 05:12.449
No problem.

127
05:12.849 --> 05:13.690
Thanks, honey.

128
05:21.649 --> 05:22.610
Could you add

129
05:22.649 --> 05:23.570
a splash of milk to it?

130
05:24.690 --> 05:25.610
Sure, no problem.

131
05:33.769 --> 05:34.490
Wait, is there

132
05:34.490 --> 05:35.370
a cup missing?

133
05:41.050 --> 05:41.769
I'm sorry.

134
05:42.610 --> 05:44.130
I accidentally broke it.

135
05:44.289 --> 05:44.730
What?

136
05:44.889 --> 05:46.289
Why didn't you tell me?

137
05:46.449 --> 05:47.529
I need that for my shoot.

138
05:49.490 --> 05:50.209
Don't worry.

139
05:50.849 --> 05:51.409
I asked

140
05:51.409 --> 05:52.539
the brand for a replacement.

141
05:55.010 --> 05:55.329
Wait.

142
05:56.329 --> 05:57.250
What do you mean?

143
05:57.889 --> 05:59.010
If I hadn't noticed today,

144
05:59.089 --> 06:00.170
would you two have kept it

145
06:00.209 --> 06:00.610
from me?

146
06:01.409 --> 06:01.889
Ms. Hui,

147
06:02.329 --> 06:03.570
is this how you handle things?

148
06:06.089 --> 06:06.732
How much was it?

149
06:07.409 --> 06:08.289
I'll pay you triple.

150
06:08.449 --> 06:09.089
It's priceless.

151
06:09.289 --> 06:10.289
It was a custom-made gift

152
06:10.370 --> 06:11.570
from the brand.

153
06:11.849 --> 06:12.599
It's not for sale.

154
06:12.649 --> 06:13.769
What good is your money?

155
06:17.289 --> 06:18.018
What's that smell?

156
06:18.610 --> 06:18.969
Ms. Hui,

157
06:19.170 --> 06:20.130
check the kitchen.

158
06:20.969 --> 06:22.026
It's the bird's nest stew.

159
06:29.529 --> 06:30.610
What's with you, honey?

160
06:31.409 --> 06:32.209
Why do you always

161
06:32.250 --> 06:33.050
take her side?

162
06:35.810 --> 06:37.570
Of course I'm on your side, honey.

163
06:38.289 --> 06:39.010
It's just that

164
06:39.730 --> 06:40.849
when Ms. Hui broke the cup,

165
06:40.889 --> 06:42.089
I happened to be right there.

166
06:42.690 --> 06:43.649
She was terrified

167
06:43.690 --> 06:44.570
and felt so guilty.

168
06:45.010 --> 06:46.250
She kept apologizing to me

169
06:46.529 --> 06:47.515
and asked to pay for it.

170
06:48.490 --> 06:49.969
I felt bad for her,

171
06:50.570 --> 06:51.250
so I let it go.

172
06:52.089 --> 06:53.010
I was about to tell you

173
06:53.010 --> 06:53.769
when you noticed.

174
06:54.649 --> 06:55.930
If you go after her now,

175
06:56.449 --> 06:57.889
aren't you undercutting me?

176
07:03.969 --> 07:05.250
I was just teasing Ms. Hui.

177
07:06.690 --> 07:07.329
Ms. Hui,

178
07:07.969 --> 07:09.570
is the bird's nest ready? I'd like some.

179
07:10.250 --> 07:10.849
It's ready.

180
07:16.849 --> 07:17.697
Have the bird's nest.

181
07:17.730 --> 07:18.570
Skip the coffee.

182
07:19.329 --> 07:20.358
I added some astragalus.

183
07:22.170 --> 07:22.730
Thanks.

184
07:35.889 --> 07:36.409
What's wrong?

185
07:41.170 --> 07:42.490
No. My stomach feels awful.

186
07:42.889 --> 07:44.089
Easy, easy.

187
07:47.209 --> 07:48.010
My stomach hurts.

188
07:55.170 --> 07:56.409
I'm okay now, honey.

189
07:57.810 --> 07:58.810
You were fine just now.

190
07:58.930 --> 07:59.742
Why'd you throw up?

191
08:00.409 --> 08:01.377
Should we see a doctor?

192
08:02.810 --> 08:03.089
Here.

193
08:03.089 --> 08:04.449
No need, honey.

194
08:04.730 --> 08:05.570
I'm fine now.

195
08:06.449 --> 08:07.490
Throwing up like that...

196
08:08.409 --> 08:09.730
Did you eat something bad?

197
08:14.930 --> 08:16.409
Not really.

198
08:17.209 --> 08:17.969
I've been eating

199
08:17.969 --> 08:19.250
pretty normally lately.

200
08:20.209 --> 08:21.529
Though it has been weird.

201
08:21.969 --> 08:23.889
All the delicious stuff

202
08:24.170 --> 08:25.050
I used to love,

203
08:25.050 --> 08:25.849
like meat,

204
08:26.170 --> 08:27.370
makes me nauseous

205
08:27.449 --> 08:28.170
looking at it.

206
08:29.050 --> 08:30.010
And the sour

207
08:30.130 --> 08:30.769
and spicy foods

208
08:30.769 --> 08:31.490
I used to dislike

209
08:31.649 --> 08:32.889
actually feel fine to eat now.

210
08:33.689 --> 08:34.610
How long

211
08:34.730 --> 08:35.689
has this been going on?

212
08:36.689 --> 08:38.210
Probably

213
08:38.689 --> 08:39.610
about a month now.

214
08:41.929 --> 08:43.090
Has your period been regular?

215
08:44.610 --> 08:45.689
I've been so busy lately

216
08:46.370 --> 08:47.130
I didn't track it.

217
08:47.850 --> 08:48.529
Let me think.

218
08:49.049 --> 08:50.250
Last month was...

219
08:52.169 --> 08:53.490
Wait, I'm over two weeks late.

220
09:02.929 --> 09:03.409
Then

221
09:04.250 --> 09:05.769
could you be pregnant?

222
09:54.850 --> 09:55.250
Honey,

223
09:56.169 --> 09:57.165
I need a new toothbrush.

224
09:57.529 --> 09:58.450
The one I'm using

225
09:58.610 --> 09:59.169
is all frayed.

226
10:02.610 --> 10:03.409
But that toothbrush

227
10:03.409 --> 10:04.490
isn't even that old.

228
10:04.610 --> 10:05.649
Why is it frayed already?

229
10:06.809 --> 10:07.250
All right,

230
10:07.511 --> 10:08.049
I'll get you

231
10:08.049 --> 10:08.689
a new one later.

232
10:10.450 --> 10:10.850
Ms. Hui,

233
10:11.689 --> 10:13.130
could you unpack the package

234
10:13.130 --> 10:13.806
on the counter?

235
10:14.289 --> 10:14.610
Sure.

236
10:33.130 --> 10:33.649
Honey,

237
10:34.409 --> 10:35.610
you can't eat this.

238
10:43.689 --> 10:44.350
This one's fine.

239
10:45.049 --> 10:45.689
Have mine.

240
10:47.649 --> 10:48.490
If you're pregnant,

241
10:49.250 --> 10:50.409
you shouldn't eat raw food.

242
10:50.850 --> 10:52.049
That's what it said

243
10:52.289 --> 10:53.649
in that guide you had me read.

244
10:53.970 --> 10:55.490
Thank you, honey.

245
10:56.370 --> 10:57.809
I can really see

246
10:58.169 --> 10:59.130
how excited you are

247
10:59.169 --> 11:00.450
to have a baby.

248
11:12.683 --> 11:13.581
(Raw Sea Cucumber)

249
11:16.769 --> 11:17.210
Ms. Hui,

250
11:17.689 --> 11:19.169
these local specialties are for you.

251
11:19.730 --> 11:20.730
I've booked your ticket

252
11:20.929 --> 11:21.874
for tomorrow afternoon.

253
11:22.090 --> 11:22.889
Take them back

254
11:23.130 --> 11:24.129
for your family to try.

255
11:24.970 --> 11:25.529
Thank you.

256
11:26.490 --> 11:27.250
But no need.

257
11:28.210 --> 11:29.210
I'm not leaving.

258
11:32.049 --> 11:32.889
Really, Ms. Hui?

259
11:33.529 --> 11:34.370
You're staying?

260
11:35.610 --> 11:37.130
No changing your mind this time.

261
11:37.689 --> 11:38.250
I won't.

262
11:38.769 --> 11:39.929
Given your condition,

263
11:40.289 --> 11:41.010
I can't leave.

264
11:42.330 --> 11:43.689
That's wonderful, Ms. Hui.

265
11:43.970 --> 11:45.330
I didn't want you to leave anyway.

266
11:46.090 --> 11:46.649
Honey,

267
11:47.130 --> 11:48.130
cancel the ticket.

268
11:51.450 --> 11:52.130
I'm off to work.

269
11:54.730 --> 11:56.210
You haven't even finished eating.

270
11:57.049 --> 11:57.409
What's...

271
11:58.289 --> 11:59.370
What's with him?

272
12:15.409 --> 12:16.370
(I'm not leaving.)

273
12:19.210 --> 12:21.130
I... I'll come back later.

274
12:21.689 --> 12:22.130
What is it?

275
12:31.169 --> 12:32.010
Nothing much.

276
12:32.809 --> 12:33.730
I mentioned before

277
12:34.250 --> 12:35.769
that my sister just graduated

278
12:35.850 --> 12:37.136
and wants to work in Jiangzhou.

279
12:37.250 --> 12:38.529
I want to rent a place for her.

280
12:39.250 --> 12:40.769
Could I get a month's salary

281
12:40.809 --> 12:42.049
advance from you?

282
12:45.010 --> 12:45.769
And your parents?

283
12:46.730 --> 12:47.370
Why are you

284
12:47.409 --> 12:48.289
worrying about that?

285
12:48.490 --> 12:49.090
As you know,

286
12:49.490 --> 12:50.450
I'm from a rural area.

287
12:51.049 --> 12:51.809
My parents are old

288
12:51.850 --> 12:52.569
with no pension,

289
12:53.049 --> 12:54.210
and money is tight.

290
12:55.010 --> 12:56.450
I want to help them out.

291
12:56.769 --> 12:57.610
Am I your dad?

292
12:59.130 --> 13:00.130
Are you my son?

293
13:01.210 --> 13:02.529
If your own parents won't pay,

294
13:03.330 --> 13:04.569
why the heck are you asking me?

295
13:04.769 --> 13:06.130
(Xiaocheng, 20 years ago) Is your wife having a baby an excuse?

296
13:06.649 --> 13:07.937
Whose wife doesn't have babies?

297
13:08.010 --> 13:09.409
I gave you the chance

298
13:09.569 --> 13:10.409
to be team lead.

299
13:10.610 --> 13:11.769
You should be grateful.

300
13:12.450 --> 13:13.289
Now look at you,

301
13:13.850 --> 13:15.169
threatening me with your sales

302
13:15.689 --> 13:16.689
and demanding an advance.

303
13:17.130 --> 13:17.951
What are you doing?

304
13:19.169 --> 13:20.929
I hit my target every month

305
13:21.689 --> 13:22.825
and exceeded it for months.

306
13:23.689 --> 13:24.529
Asking for an advance

307
13:26.010 --> 13:26.790
isn't out of line.

308
13:29.210 --> 13:29.769
Says who?

309
13:30.569 --> 13:31.569
Did you make the rules?

310
13:31.889 --> 13:34.210
There are plenty of other options.

311
13:35.210 --> 13:36.370
Don't come crying poor to me.

312
13:36.529 --> 13:37.529
What's with the attitude?

313
13:38.330 --> 13:38.929
Sorry, Manager.

314
13:39.250 --> 13:39.809
I'm desperate.

315
13:39.809 --> 13:41.210
No money? Go ask your old man.

316
13:42.130 --> 13:42.529
Right,

317
13:43.130 --> 13:44.210
your parents are dead,

318
13:44.250 --> 13:44.734
aren't they?

319
13:46.529 --> 13:47.769
Hit me and I'll call the cops.

320
13:47.850 --> 13:48.250
And then

321
13:48.450 --> 13:49.010
you won't get

322
13:49.010 --> 13:49.768
this month's pay.

323
13:51.169 --> 13:51.649
Let go.

324
14:05.370 --> 14:05.809
Come back.

325
14:08.689 --> 14:09.582
How much do you need?

326
14:09.889 --> 14:10.598
I'll transfer it.

327
14:10.850 --> 14:11.409
Honey,

328
14:12.169 --> 14:13.490
look at these baby clothes.

329
14:13.529 --> 14:14.253
Aren't they cute?

330
14:15.250 --> 14:15.730
Honey,

331
14:16.010 --> 14:17.130
your taste is always good.

332
14:18.409 --> 14:18.850
By the way,

333
14:19.370 --> 14:20.490
I'll take you for a checkup

334
14:20.490 --> 14:21.289
tomorrow.

335
14:22.730 --> 14:23.769
No rush.

336
14:24.130 --> 14:25.289
I have work tomorrow.

337
14:25.529 --> 14:26.809
Besides, aren't you busy too?

338
14:27.130 --> 14:28.130
I'll find time

339
14:28.250 --> 14:29.610
and have Liu Zi go with me.

340
14:30.769 --> 14:31.289
Ms. Hui.

341
14:31.850 --> 14:32.929
Ms. Hui, come here.

342
14:33.490 --> 14:33.929
Coming.

343
14:39.569 --> 14:40.689
Ms. Hui, take a look.

344
14:41.569 --> 14:42.529
Are these clothes cute?

345
14:42.569 --> 14:43.210
Are they good?

346
14:43.850 --> 14:44.289
And these?

347
14:48.289 --> 14:48.889
Not really.

348
14:52.289 --> 14:53.929
Clothes with buttons and zippers

349
14:54.250 --> 14:55.169
might look nice

350
14:55.210 --> 14:55.809
and cute,

351
14:55.970 --> 14:56.409
but

352
14:56.850 --> 14:58.450
they can easily scratch a baby's skin.

353
15:02.090 --> 15:03.130
That's true.

354
15:03.970 --> 15:04.529
See?

355
15:04.769 --> 15:06.010
Ms. Hui really has experience.

356
15:06.529 --> 15:06.929
Ms. Hui,

357
15:07.409 --> 15:08.569
if I ever need help,

358
15:08.610 --> 15:09.289
I'll come to you.

359
15:10.090 --> 15:10.689
Honey,

360
15:11.169 --> 15:12.809
you should learn along with me.

361
15:13.289 --> 15:14.370
Don't be clueless

362
15:14.370 --> 15:15.300
when I ask you later.

363
15:15.929 --> 15:16.649
Me?

364
15:18.610 --> 15:19.500
Once the baby is born,

365
15:19.529 --> 15:20.450
I'll study it properly.

366
15:21.130 --> 15:21.610
Right.

367
15:22.929 --> 15:23.529
Baby clothes

368
15:23.529 --> 15:24.689
aren't as interesting as your

369
15:24.689 --> 15:25.581
financial statements.

370
15:26.569 --> 15:27.330
Why are you

371
15:27.450 --> 15:28.450
suddenly getting mad?

372
15:28.610 --> 15:29.970
It's pre-pregnancy anxiety, okay?

373
15:30.529 --> 15:31.610
If you cared about me,

374
15:31.769 --> 15:32.656
would I be like this?

375
15:32.929 --> 15:34.250
The baby hasn't been born yet.

376
15:34.529 --> 15:35.569
When the baby comes,

377
15:35.850 --> 15:36.771
you won't know anything

378
15:36.809 --> 15:37.970
or do anything I ask.

379
15:38.450 --> 15:39.689
What am I supposed to do?

380
15:40.529 --> 15:41.850
Are all men like this?

381
15:44.010 --> 15:44.529
Ms. Hui,

382
15:46.049 --> 15:47.610
was your ex-husband like this too?

383
15:48.130 --> 15:49.210
So you divorced him?

384
15:50.929 --> 15:51.850
When you were pregnant,

385
15:52.529 --> 15:53.569
did he care about these?

386
15:56.569 --> 15:57.330
Back then,

387
15:57.450 --> 15:59.409
disposable diapers were just getting popular.

388
16:00.090 --> 16:01.250
People weren't that picky.

389
16:03.769 --> 16:05.090
Did he help change

390
16:05.130 --> 16:06.049
the baby's diapers?

391
16:07.889 --> 16:08.250
No.

392
16:08.689 --> 16:09.569
What about feeding

393
16:09.929 --> 16:11.049
or making baby food?

394
16:13.330 --> 16:13.730
He didn't.

395
16:15.809 --> 16:17.970
What if the baby woke up in the night,

396
16:18.130 --> 16:19.169
crying and fussing?

397
16:19.409 --> 16:20.173
Did he soothe them?

398
16:21.210 --> 16:21.649
No.

399
16:22.169 --> 16:23.529
Unbelievable.

400
16:25.010 --> 16:26.090
He was totally useless.

401
16:27.450 --> 16:29.049
No wonder you divorced him.

402
16:29.529 --> 16:29.970
No,

403
16:31.169 --> 16:31.889
I don't blame him.

404
16:32.370 --> 16:33.649
I actually felt bad for him.

405
16:34.689 --> 16:35.250
Back then,

406
16:35.250 --> 16:36.330
to provide for the family,

407
16:36.809 --> 16:37.889
he worked several jobs

408
16:38.569 --> 16:39.529
and barely had time

409
16:39.569 --> 16:40.049
to sleep.

410
16:42.130 --> 16:43.769
Given what you said,

411
16:44.130 --> 16:44.809
you two

412
16:44.809 --> 16:46.169
seemed pretty close.

413
16:47.049 --> 16:47.649
Ms. Hui,

414
16:48.409 --> 16:49.049
come sit here.

415
16:49.210 --> 16:49.959
Don't stand there.

416
16:50.010 --> 16:50.409
Come on.

417
16:58.490 --> 16:58.809
Here.

418
16:59.529 --> 17:00.090
Thank you.

419
17:00.569 --> 17:02.010
If you were so close,

420
17:02.929 --> 17:03.769
why did you divorce?

421
17:04.170 --> 17:05.093
We weren't compatible.

422
17:06.609 --> 17:07.329
Incompatible?

423
17:09.569 --> 17:11.089
How long were you together

424
17:11.129 --> 17:12.093
before getting divorced?

425
17:12.650 --> 17:13.289
Over...

426
17:15.289 --> 17:15.890
over ten years.

427
17:18.410 --> 17:19.490
Over ten years?

428
17:19.650 --> 17:21.049
Then it wasn't about personality.

429
17:23.089 --> 17:23.769
Did he cheat?

430
17:25.690 --> 17:26.250
Debt?

431
17:27.849 --> 17:28.369
Abuse?

432
17:30.329 --> 17:30.890
I know.

433
17:31.849 --> 17:32.730
He hid money from you.

434
17:35.930 --> 17:37.529
Don't tell me he was married before

435
17:38.450 --> 17:39.806
and had a child out of wedlock?

436
17:41.410 --> 17:41.890
No.

437
17:42.329 --> 17:42.930
None of that.

438
17:48.010 --> 17:49.049
Then he must have done

439
17:49.049 --> 17:50.289
something that broke your heart

440
17:51.129 --> 17:52.170
for you to divorce him.

441
17:57.609 --> 17:58.329
Ms. Hui,

442
17:58.970 --> 18:00.170
this is the first

443
18:00.210 --> 18:00.930
I've heard of it.

444
18:01.529 --> 18:02.490
Tell me more.

445
18:02.849 --> 18:04.049
I can help you talk it out.

446
18:04.129 --> 18:04.890
Don't bottle

447
18:04.930 --> 18:06.049
everything up inside.

448
18:06.170 --> 18:07.809
Venting to me will help relieve stress.

449
18:07.930 --> 18:09.210
Bottling it up makes you sick

450
18:09.329 --> 18:10.369
and depressed.

451
18:14.369 --> 18:15.129
Honey,

452
18:15.890 --> 18:17.529
you're way off track now.

453
18:18.329 --> 18:19.129
Your imagination

454
18:19.129 --> 18:20.250
is running wild.

455
18:20.569 --> 18:21.970
Ms. Hui isn't that fragile.

456
18:22.970 --> 18:23.410
Ms. Hui,

457
18:24.202 --> 18:25.329
Meng and I are going to look

458
18:25.329 --> 18:26.010
at baby clothes.

459
18:26.289 --> 18:26.609
Okay.

460
18:26.690 --> 18:27.410
Go back to work.

461
18:29.410 --> 18:29.849
Ms. Hui,

462
18:30.490 --> 18:32.289
a woman at fifty is in her prime.

463
18:32.650 --> 18:33.690
You can definitely find

464
18:33.690 --> 18:34.609
a better man.

465
18:39.010 --> 18:39.730
I'm forty-one.

466
18:42.289 --> 18:42.690
You...

467
18:43.450 --> 18:45.690
You're younger than Liren?

468
18:47.129 --> 18:47.714
Don't worry.

469
18:48.049 --> 18:48.849
Leave it to me.

470
18:49.089 --> 18:50.289
I have tons of anti-aging

471
18:50.289 --> 18:51.210
facial masks.

472
18:51.450 --> 18:52.529
I'll grab some for you now.

473
18:52.529 --> 18:53.329
You can use them.

474
18:53.490 --> 18:54.369
They work wonders.

475
18:54.650 --> 18:55.809
There are hydrating ones

476
18:55.809 --> 18:56.890
and brightening ones, too.

477
19:16.210 --> 19:17.210
Sweep gently.

478
19:17.410 --> 19:18.650
You're kicking up dust.

479
19:19.755 --> 19:20.650
A fifty-year-old woman

480
19:20.650 --> 19:21.818
can't control her strength.

481
19:26.650 --> 19:27.279
Lift your feet.

482
19:29.250 --> 19:29.809
Unbelievable.

483
19:31.930 --> 19:33.450
Why aren't you leaving anymore?

484
19:35.167 --> 19:35.769
To help you two

485
19:35.769 --> 19:36.705
take care of the baby.

486
19:40.329 --> 19:41.490
She hasn't even been tested.

487
19:41.650 --> 19:42.410
Why would she have

488
19:42.410 --> 19:43.170
pregnancy symptoms?

489
19:44.129 --> 19:44.769
Didn't you

490
19:45.210 --> 19:46.250
have a vasectomy?

491
19:57.087 --> 19:58.769
There's something I haven't had the chance

492
19:58.769 --> 19:59.329
to tell you.

493
20:00.049 --> 20:00.970
I owe you an apology.

494
20:02.529 --> 20:04.049
Because she wasn't getting pregnant,

495
20:04.204 --> 20:05.170
Yu Meng and her parents

496
20:05.170 --> 20:05.904
kept scheduling me

497
20:05.904 --> 20:07.282
for tests at different hospitals.

498
20:08.369 --> 20:08.930
A while back,

499
20:08.930 --> 20:10.609
I couldn't put it off anymore.

500
20:11.930 --> 20:14.210
I was worried the vasectomy

501
20:14.369 --> 20:14.970
would be found,

502
20:15.329 --> 20:17.010
so I had a reversal surgery.

503
20:17.289 --> 20:18.010
Which means

504
20:18.769 --> 20:19.701
Yu Meng might actually

505
20:19.701 --> 20:20.674
be carrying your baby?

506
20:24.210 --> 20:25.210
What about our child?

507
20:26.289 --> 20:27.329
Do you want me or her?

508
20:27.769 --> 20:28.809
You, of course.

509
20:29.329 --> 20:30.369
Even if she is pregnant,

510
20:30.569 --> 20:31.369
I'd never let her

511
20:31.410 --> 20:32.450
have the baby.

512
20:32.930 --> 20:33.849
Are you satisfied now?

513
20:34.089 --> 20:35.089
It's your choice.

514
20:35.849 --> 20:36.890
Don't make me look like

515
20:36.890 --> 20:37.378
the bad guy.

516
20:37.730 --> 20:38.730
It's my decision.

517
20:38.849 --> 20:40.114
It has nothing to do with you.

518
20:40.769 --> 20:41.650
Did you ever think

519
20:42.369 --> 20:43.170
about what last name

520
20:43.250 --> 20:44.154
this child would take?

521
20:48.289 --> 20:48.849
Yu.

522
20:49.730 --> 20:50.609
There you have it.

523
20:51.144 --> 20:52.289
I married into their family.

524
20:52.289 --> 20:53.049
To put it bluntly,

525
20:53.049 --> 20:54.210
I'm just a tool to them,

526
20:54.529 --> 20:55.849
with no status and no dignity.

527
20:56.609 --> 20:57.609
How could I have a child

528
20:57.769 --> 20:58.785
not bearing my last name

529
20:58.809 --> 21:00.047
to remind me of my humiliation?

530
21:00.329 --> 21:01.450
Did sleeping in the nursery

531
21:01.490 --> 21:02.289
make you sensitive?

532
21:03.289 --> 21:04.970
She put that room together herself.

533
21:05.129 --> 21:05.970
I had no part of it.

534
21:06.089 --> 21:07.329
But I couldn't stop her.

535
21:09.010 --> 21:10.089
You can understand, right?

536
21:12.890 --> 21:13.930
All right.

537
21:14.369 --> 21:15.010
There, now.

538
21:23.690 --> 21:24.289
Honey?

539
21:25.490 --> 21:26.609
What are you two doing?

540
21:27.250 --> 21:28.849
I saw how pretty the flowers were

541
21:29.049 --> 21:29.970
and wanted to cut some,

542
21:30.170 --> 21:30.976
put them in a vase,

543
21:31.049 --> 21:32.010
and take them to you.

544
21:32.210 --> 21:33.210
I didn't expect to get

545
21:33.210 --> 21:34.170
a thorn in my hand.

546
21:34.490 --> 21:35.890
Ms. Hui was taking it out for me.

547
21:36.329 --> 21:37.250
It's already out.

548
21:37.569 --> 21:39.210
Wash it with soapy water

549
21:39.369 --> 21:40.050
so it won't itch.

550
21:40.210 --> 21:40.690
Okay.

551
21:46.410 --> 21:48.210
You're so sweet to me, honey.

552
21:48.650 --> 21:49.850
It's the middle of the night,

553
21:50.129 --> 21:51.624
and you were cutting flowers for me.

554
21:53.049 --> 21:55.289
These flowers really are pretty,

555
21:56.690 --> 21:58.690
but this twin blossom stem

556
21:59.329 --> 22:00.849
looks undernourished.

557
22:01.890 --> 22:03.569
One branch needs to be cut off,

558
22:03.890 --> 22:04.650
or else

559
22:04.849 --> 22:06.210
they'll compete for nutrients.

560
22:12.690 --> 22:13.210
Here, honey.

561
22:13.569 --> 22:14.210
Pick one

562
22:14.730 --> 22:15.289
and cut it.

563
22:30.650 --> 22:31.809
We can't cut this.

564
22:31.970 --> 22:32.650
Why not?

565
22:33.529 --> 22:34.529
Twin blooms on one stem

566
22:34.529 --> 22:35.614
bring double the blessings.

567
22:36.289 --> 22:38.210
Twin blossoms symbolize good fortune.

568
22:38.410 --> 22:39.529
Cutting one brings bad luck.

569
22:41.609 --> 22:43.289
Brings bad luck?

570
22:43.650 --> 22:44.609
Bad luck for whom?

571
22:45.129 --> 22:46.289
For our family, of course.

572
22:47.569 --> 22:48.809
Plants are part of feng shui.

573
22:51.650 --> 22:52.609
Fair enough.

574
22:52.769 --> 22:53.769
Still, I think

575
22:54.250 --> 22:55.514
people shouldn't be too greedy.

576
22:55.890 --> 22:56.890
Wanting it all

577
22:57.049 --> 22:58.329
most likely means

578
22:58.490 --> 22:59.970
ending up with nothing.

579
23:18.170 --> 23:19.049
Why cut this one?

580
23:19.609 --> 23:21.010
It's thriving and well-nourished.

581
23:21.329 --> 23:22.369
Planted anywhere,

582
23:22.690 --> 23:23.769
it can blossom beautifully.

583
23:24.369 --> 23:25.609
It doesn't need other branches

584
23:26.010 --> 23:27.529
or to steal nutrients from anyone.

585
23:28.809 --> 23:29.970
As for this

586
23:30.129 --> 23:31.410
withering blossom,

587
23:32.529 --> 23:34.410
whether it waits around to die

588
23:34.529 --> 23:35.970
or rises from the ashes

589
23:36.089 --> 23:36.690
will depend

590
23:36.730 --> 23:37.650
on its own choice.

591
23:39.650 --> 23:41.010
Cuttings don't always take root.

592
23:42.329 --> 23:43.809
I have the ability and confidence

593
23:44.329 --> 23:45.569
to make sure it survives.

594
23:47.329 --> 23:48.210
Honey,

595
23:48.690 --> 23:49.450
what video account

596
23:49.450 --> 23:50.289
did you get this

597
23:50.369 --> 23:51.289
chicken soup from?

598
23:53.210 --> 23:53.890
(We can agree to)

599
23:54.010 --> 23:55.089
(Dr. Kang's terms.)

600
23:55.250 --> 23:56.529
(You are now authorized)

601
23:56.650 --> 23:58.089
(to negotiate with Dr. Kang.)

602
23:58.170 --> 23:59.769
(We hope you can close the deal.)

603
24:01.617 --> 24:02.418
Enjoy the flowers.

604
24:02.809 --> 24:03.609
I'm going to sleep.

605
24:04.250 --> 24:05.129
Good night.

606
24:14.849 --> 24:15.490
Haven't you

607
24:15.529 --> 24:16.490
gotten authorization?

608
24:16.890 --> 24:18.170
Just reach out to Dr. Kang.

609
24:19.129 --> 24:20.569
That's way too stiff.

610
24:20.809 --> 24:22.129
The best way to start

611
24:22.129 --> 24:24.329
a partnership is to make friends first.

612
24:24.650 --> 24:25.210
Meaning?

613
24:25.569 --> 24:26.089
Just wait.

614
24:32.365 --> 24:34.075
(Chemical Raw Material: Hydroxytyrosol)

615
24:38.769 --> 24:39.809
Look at the photo.

616
24:46.369 --> 24:47.569
You're going to promote

617
24:47.569 --> 24:48.609
the doctor's book,

618
24:48.890 --> 24:50.529
doing him a favor?

619
24:50.890 --> 24:51.410
Exactly.

620
24:51.809 --> 24:53.250
I bought up all the copies

621
24:53.369 --> 24:54.650
of Dr. Kang Long's book

622
24:54.650 --> 24:55.569
at the bookstore.

623
24:56.010 --> 24:57.609
Once the company gives authorization,

624
24:57.970 --> 24:59.289
I'll immediately

625
24:59.289 --> 25:00.010
promote it

626
25:00.210 --> 25:01.329
on Moments

627
25:01.329 --> 25:01.970
and the account

628
25:02.129 --> 25:02.920
of Lucky Beauty Yu.

629
25:03.519 --> 25:04.329
We can have students

630
25:04.329 --> 25:05.289
repost it for a giveaway

631
25:05.569 --> 25:06.650
and drum up buzz

632
25:06.769 --> 25:07.450
in the comments.

633
25:07.809 --> 25:09.010
When Dr. Kang Long sees

634
25:09.730 --> 25:10.849
how great the numbers are,

635
25:10.970 --> 25:11.809
won't he naturally

636
25:11.809 --> 25:12.369
be eager

637
25:12.690 --> 25:13.650
to talk with me?

638
25:15.970 --> 25:16.970
Rule One to charm a man:

639
25:17.250 --> 25:19.410
shower him with adoration.

640
25:19.730 --> 25:21.010
I think when the time comes,

641
25:21.329 --> 25:22.010
we should

642
25:22.490 --> 25:23.569
shoot the wide shot first

643
25:23.970 --> 25:25.210
and then zoom in.

644
25:25.329 --> 25:26.069
What do you think?

645
25:26.849 --> 25:27.690
Sounds good to me.

646
25:28.410 --> 25:29.170
The main thing

647
25:29.690 --> 25:30.529
is this part.

648
25:30.569 --> 25:31.089
(Script) Take a look.

649
25:36.170 --> 25:36.650
(Ms. Yu,)

650
25:36.885 --> 25:37.857
(this Sunday at 2:00 PM,)

651
25:37.857 --> 25:38.552
(are you free?)

652
25:38.841 --> 25:39.690
(We can talk further)

653
25:39.690 --> 25:40.369
(about the contract.)

654
25:40.369 --> 25:41.053
There's progress.

655
25:41.529 --> 25:42.569
Kang Long messaged me.

656
25:46.450 --> 25:47.809
See? When it comes to men,

657
25:48.129 --> 25:48.769
no gift beats

658
25:48.769 --> 25:50.049
pure adoration.

659
25:50.730 --> 25:51.815
I must say, Mr. Jiao really

660
25:52.129 --> 25:53.129
has a way with words.

661
25:54.329 --> 25:54.809
Yep.

662
25:58.289 --> 25:58.769
Okay.

663
26:01.450 --> 26:02.369
But didn't he agree

664
26:02.369 --> 26:03.250
way too quickly?

665
26:04.170 --> 26:05.369
I only posted it yesterday.

666
26:05.970 --> 26:07.049
The comment section

667
26:07.049 --> 26:08.129
hasn't even heated up yet.

668
26:08.450 --> 26:09.410
and he already agreed.

669
26:10.609 --> 26:11.890
Besides, a worldly man

670
26:12.049 --> 26:13.450
like him could be

671
26:13.609 --> 26:14.809
bought off by a few words

672
26:15.170 --> 26:15.970
and some copies?

673
26:16.490 --> 26:17.569
Maybe he checked out

674
26:17.569 --> 26:18.529
your social media

675
26:18.690 --> 26:20.052
and saw your commercial potential.

676
26:22.170 --> 26:23.170
I think so too.

677
26:26.289 --> 26:27.849
Great.

678
26:27.849 --> 26:29.579
(Popular blogger Lucky Beauty Yu vanishes after a cryptic video)

679
26:29.579 --> 26:30.397
(Clues point to her husband, Jiali Cosmetics chairman)

680
26:30.397 --> 26:31.447
(What a bombshell. I wonder what really happened?)

681
26:31.447 --> 26:32.167
(I saw her before. She was gorgeous)

682
26:32.167 --> 26:33.797
(She seemed upset after a phone call. Something must've happened)

683
26:33.797 --> 26:35.143
(She's back, so she's probably fine. Maybe the couple just had a fight)

684
26:35.143 --> 26:38.531
(With her bestie, she's totally alive again)

685
26:49.250 --> 26:49.930
Hello, Ms. Yu.

686
26:50.089 --> 26:51.049
Hello, Dr. Kang Long.

687
26:57.569 --> 26:58.089
And this is?

688
26:59.410 --> 27:00.129
I told you I have

689
27:00.329 --> 27:02.049
a great partner named Liu Zi.

690
27:02.107 --> 27:03.210
