1034
38:07.209 --> 38:08.330
(I want to clock out.)

1035
38:09.290 --> 38:10.410
(Last time, because of her,)

1036
38:10.410 --> 38:11.770
(the product launch was delayed.)

1037
38:12.049 --> 38:12.850
(I worked overtime)

1038
38:12.890 --> 38:13.970
(for half a month.)

1039
38:14.490 --> 38:15.850
(And now here she is again.)

1040
38:16.089 --> 38:17.850
(Even wage slaves need a nightlife.)

1041
38:18.569 --> 38:19.249
Look.

1042
38:19.689 --> 38:21.129
She posted that in the group chat.

1043
38:21.689 --> 38:23.609
The boss's wife is in the group too.

1044
38:23.930 --> 38:25.249
So awkward.

1045
38:26.770 --> 38:27.209
(Tickets)

1046
38:27.209 --> 38:28.689
These photos are?

1047
38:30.890 --> 38:33.290
Misunderstandings should be cleared up on the spot.

1048
38:34.450 --> 38:35.609
I posted these photos

1049
38:35.689 --> 38:36.770
to tell you all

1050
38:37.129 --> 38:38.089
Dr. Kang Long

1051
38:38.410 --> 38:39.295
was brought in by me.

1052
38:40.689 --> 38:41.169
Dr. Kang,

1053
38:41.529 --> 38:42.410
I remember this was

1054
38:42.609 --> 38:43.209
the first time

1055
38:43.209 --> 38:43.970
I met you, right?

1056
38:44.169 --> 38:45.174
You really went for it.

1057
38:45.529 --> 38:46.330
With an injured leg,

1058
38:46.403 --> 38:47.450
you chased me all the way.

1059
38:47.450 --> 38:48.010
I even thought

1060
38:48.129 --> 38:49.587
Jiali was mistreating its employees.

1061
38:51.410 --> 38:52.719
You didn't agree to work with us

1062
38:52.770 --> 38:53.490
just because

1063
38:53.689 --> 38:54.899
you felt sorry for me, right?

1064
38:55.490 --> 38:56.330
It's because you're

1065
38:56.330 --> 38:56.810
professional

1066
38:57.209 --> 38:57.850
and sincere.

1067
38:58.450 --> 38:59.334
You're worth trusting.

1068
39:00.609 --> 39:01.410
Thank you, Dr. Kang.

1069
39:02.010 --> 39:02.609
Meng,

1070
39:03.089 --> 39:04.810
I'm sorry. I misunderstood.

1071
39:07.089 --> 39:07.810
It's okay.

1072
39:08.450 --> 39:09.810
Anyone can be misunderstood.

1073
39:10.169 --> 39:10.810
Actually,

1074
39:11.290 --> 39:12.370
while I have the chance,

1075
39:12.970 --> 39:14.179
I'd like to apologize to you.

1076
39:14.689 --> 39:16.049
The previous product launch

1077
39:16.450 --> 39:17.770
was delayed because of me.

1078
39:18.049 --> 39:19.049
I caused you trouble.

1079
39:19.850 --> 39:21.770
I'll drink this glass to all of you.

1080
39:23.330 --> 39:24.689
- Meng. - Meng.

1081
39:28.169 --> 39:28.850
- Bye. - Bye.

1082
39:31.770 --> 39:32.290
Meng,

1083
39:32.689 --> 39:34.049
I'm at the restaurant entrance.

1084
39:34.569 --> 39:35.689
I'll come pick you up now.

1085
39:49.031 --> 39:51.810
=The Vanishing Beauty= (Next Episode Preview)

1086
39:51.810 --> 39:52.169
Dump it.

1087
39:52.330 --> 39:53.328
I think you've forgotten

1088
39:53.413 --> 39:54.729
what it's like to eat leftovers.

1089
39:54.729 --> 39:55.569
To be looked down on.

1090
39:55.569 --> 39:56.416
I haven't forgotten.

1091
39:57.410 --> 39:58.450
Calm down.

1092
39:58.850 --> 39:59.609
I'm like

1093
39:59.609 --> 40:00.410
a dead volcano.

1094
40:00.529 --> 40:01.529
Been calm long enough.

1095
40:01.649 --> 40:02.649
Stay calm any longer,

1096
40:02.890 --> 40:04.249
and I'll end up as the leftovers,

1097
40:04.609 --> 40:05.729
dumped in the trash,

1098
40:06.010 --> 40:06.649
down the drain,

1099
40:06.890 --> 40:07.850
rotting away.

1100
40:08.569 --> 40:09.770
My period just started today.

1101
40:10.249 --> 40:11.370
I'm not pregnant at all.

1102
40:12.169 --> 40:13.770
Whenever I close my eyes,

1103
40:14.810 --> 40:16.890
I keep hearing these noises

1104
40:17.049 --> 40:18.209
right by my ear.

1105
40:19.330 --> 40:20.569
Noises?

1106
40:32.369 --> 40:35.801
♪We are broken butterflies♪

1107
40:36.078 --> 40:38.933
♪Can't fly beyond the boundary of fate♪

1108
40:39.302 --> 40:42.130
♪Wings torn apart by the night♪

1109
40:42.130 --> 40:45.945
♪Still seeking open fields in the ruins♪

1110
40:45.945 --> 40:47.586
♪Locked inside a pendulum♪

1111
40:47.586 --> 40:49.291
♪Repeating the same fate♪

1112
40:49.291 --> 40:50.719
♪I hear high heels♪

1113
40:50.719 --> 40:52.488
♪Crushing silent replies♪

1114
40:52.488 --> 40:54.129
♪Every step feels like a trial♪

1115
40:54.129 --> 40:55.621
♪Yet sobers me up♪

1116
40:55.621 --> 40:57.518
♪Love is a thorny rose♪

1117
40:57.518 --> 40:59.052
♪Promises are mere anesthesia♪

1118
40:59.052 --> 41:00.800
♪I once gave it my all♪

1119
41:00.800 --> 41:02.676
♪Only to be shattered in pieces♪

1120
41:02.867 --> 41:04.487
♪Now I forge my tears♪

1121
41:04.487 --> 41:06.128
♪Into gray diamond gems♪

1122
41:06.128 --> 41:07.940
♪No longer asking who's right or wrong♪

1123
41:07.940 --> 41:12.224
♪Only who dares to control me♪

1124
41:13.161 --> 41:14.866
♪I am nobody's accessory♪

1125
41:14.866 --> 41:16.422
♪Nor am I anyone's failure♪

1126
41:16.422 --> 41:17.871
♪Even with broken wings♪

1127
41:17.871 --> 41:19.299
♪I can still pierce the sky♪

1128
41:19.299 --> 41:20.962
♪When all the lights go out♪

1129
41:20.962 --> 41:24.350
♪I am the final torch♪

1130
41:24.350 --> 41:28.016
♪We are broken butterflies♪

1131
